0.925 0.957 1 rg 47 616 518 45 re f
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 657.0 Tm (In plain English: Django normally runs a server that builds pages. A static site is made) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 646.0 Tm (   of ready-to-serve HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files. A static host serves those files) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 635.0 Tm (   without running Django.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 616.0 Tm (1. Keep the existing site and its local Django work safe while making a static version.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 600.0 Tm (2. Connect sign-in to Supabase Auth, then configure Google as a Supabase provider.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 584.0 Tm (3. Improve the sign-in and dashboard experience, and keep dashboards behind login.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 568.0 Tm (4. Diagnose the Google return flow before publishing.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 552.0 Tm (5. Prepare a beginner-friendly checklist for local testing and later deployment.) Tj ET
0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 533.0 Tm (What this guide covers) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 515.0 Tm (The guide follows those steps and explains which settings live in Supabase, which live in) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 502.0 Tm (  Google Cloud, how to start the local preview, what the app does after sign-in, and what) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 489.0 Tm (  remains to verify.) Tj ET
0.925 0.957 1 rg 47 429 518 45 re f
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 470.0 Tm (You do not need to understand Django or OAuth internals to follow the setup. Use the) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 459.0 Tm (   exact URLs below and remember that Google Cloud and Supabase use two different) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 448.0 Tm (   redirect URLs.) Tj ET
0.78 0.83 0.90 RG 52 42 m 560 42 l S
