0.055 0.145 0.330 rg 0 742 612 50 re f
0.760 0.870 1.000 rg BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 762.0 Tm (TALENTBRIDGE AI  |  BEGINNER GUIDE) Tj ET
1.000 1.000 1.000 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 738.0 Tm (1. From Django to a static website) Tj ET
0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 707.0 Tm (What changed) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 689.0 Tm (The website pages are now ordinary static files. The build helper is build_static.py, and) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 676.0 Tm (  it copies public HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and images into a folder named site. GitHub Pages) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 663.0 Tm (  and Netlify publish that folder.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 646.0 Tm (The old Django code was moved into legacy-django/ rather than thrown away. This keeps it) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 633.0 Tm (  out of the static build while preserving the previous backend and local edits.) Tj ET
0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 613.0 Tm (What static hosting does not do) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 595.0 Tm (It does not run Django, Python server routes, or the old SQLite database.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 578.0 Tm (Supabase Auth handles account sign-in. Job, application, profile, employer-management, and) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 565.0 Tm (  contact workflows are demonstrations for now; they do not save records to a production) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 552.0 Tm (  database.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 535.0 Tm (Old Django accounts and SQLite records are not automatically copied to Supabase.) Tj ET
0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 515.0 Tm (Dashboard privacy) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 497.0 Tm (The dashboard pages check for a valid Supabase session. If a visitor is not signed in, the) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 484.0 Tm (  site sends them to the login page instead of showing the dashboard.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 467.0 Tm (A dashboard guard bug was found during sign-in testing: it replaced the entire page body) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 454.0 Tm (  with the account email. That behavior was removed so it updates only the small account-) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 441.0 Tm (  email label.) Tj ET
0.78 0.83 0.90 RG 52 42 m 560 42 l S
0.360 0.420 0.520 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 26.0 Tm (TalentBridge AI | Setup guide for beginners) Tj ET
0.360 0.420 0.520 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 500.0 26.0 Tm (Page 2 of 6) Tj ET
0.360 0.420 0.520 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 720 Tm (Why the project can run on GitHub Pages or Netlify) Tj ET
endstream
