stream
0.055 0.145 0.330 rg 0 742 612 50 re f
0.760 0.870 1.000 rg BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 762.0 Tm (TALENTBRIDGE AI  |  BEGINNER GUIDE) Tj ET
1.000 1.000 1.000 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 738.0 Tm (2. Connect Supabase and Google) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 710.0 Tm (1. In Supabase, open your project and go to Authentication, then Sign In / Providers.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 697.0 Tm (   Enable Google.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 681.0 Tm (2. In Google Cloud, create an OAuth client with application type Web application. Copy the) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 668.0 Tm (   client ID and client secret into the Google provider settings in Supabase. Do not put) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 655.0 Tm (   the Google secret into website files.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 639.0 Tm (3. In Google Cloud, add this Supabase callback as an Authorized redirect URI:) Tj ET
0.925 0.957 1 rg 47 602 518 23 re f
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 621.0 Tm (https://mfjutlfnpteswhivcmwh.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 602.0 Tm (4. In Supabase, open Authentication, then URL Configuration. For local testing, use Site) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 589.0 Tm (   URL http://127.0.0.1:8765.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 573.0 Tm (5. In Supabase Redirect URLs, allow the local login callback:) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 560.0 Tm (   http://127.0.0.1:8765/pages/login.html. If Supabase rejects a callback because a path or) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 547.0 Tm (   query varies, allow local preview paths with http://127.0.0.1:8765/**.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 531.0 Tm (6. The app configuration in js/supabase-config.js needs the Supabase project URL and) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 518.0 Tm (   browser-safe publishable key. These let the sign-in page contact Supabase.) Tj ET
0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 499.0 Tm (Do not mix up these URLs) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 481.0 Tm (Google Cloud Authorized redirect URI: the Supabase /auth/v1/callback address above.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 464.0 Tm (Supabase Redirect URLs: the website login page, such as) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 451.0 Tm (  http://127.0.0.1:8765/pages/login.html.) Tj ET
0.925 0.957 1 rg 47 391 518 45 re f
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 432.0 Tm (Never put a Supabase service-role key, database password, or Google OAuth client secret) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 421.0 Tm (   in JavaScript, HTML, or a public repository. The publishable key is intended for) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 410.0 Tm (   browser use; protect database access with Supabase policies.) Tj ET
0.78 0.83 0.90 RG 52 42 m 560 42 l S
0.360 0.420 0.520 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 26.0 Tm (TalentBridge AI | Setup guide for beginners) Tj ET
0.360 0.420 0.520 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 500.0 26.0 Tm (Page 3 of 6) Tj ET
0.360 0.420 0.520 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 720 Tm (Follow these steps in order; the two callback URLs are different) Tj ET
endstream
