0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 678.0 Tm (3. Start the preview server by running: python -m http.server 8765 --directory site) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 662.0 Tm (Leave that terminal open while testing. The preview address is http://127.0.0.1:8765 and) Tj ET
