0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 571.0 Tm (What successful sign-in should look like) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 553.0 Tm (Candidate account: candidate dashboard.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 536.0 Tm (Employer account: employer dashboard.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 519.0 Tm (A dashboard opened directly without a session: sent back to login.) Tj ET
0.925 0.957 1 rg 47 459 518 45 re f
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 500.0 Tm (If the page says connection refused, the local preview server is stopped. Run the server) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 489.0 Tm (   command again. The address uses 127.0.0.1; localhost is a different hostname for) Tj ET
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 478.0 Tm (   redirect matching, so keep the hostname consistent.) Tj ET
0.78 0.83 0.90 RG 52 42 m 560 42 l S
0.360 0.420 0.520 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 26.0 Tm (TalentBridge AI | Setup guide for beginners) Tj ET
