0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 680.0 Tm ("redirect_uri_mismatch" on Google: check the Google Cloud OAuth client. Its Authorized) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 667.0 Tm (  redirect URI must be https://mfjutlfnpteswhivcmwh.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback.) Tj ET
