0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 620.0 Tm (Google returns to the login page but there is no session: check the Supabase redirect) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 607.0 Tm (  allow-list and confirm the URL contains /pages/login.html. The updated page shows an) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 594.0 Tm (  error instead of silently appearing stuck.) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 577.0 Tm (Dashboard looks blank: reload the new page. The dashboard guard no longer overwrites the) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 564.0 Tm (  page body, and its script URL has a version suffix to avoid reusing a stale cached copy.) Tj ET
0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 544.0 Tm (What has been checked) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 526.0 Tm (The Supabase project reports Google enabled. The local sign-in page loaded, and the Google) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 513.0 Tm (  button opened Google using the Supabase callback. A simulated signed-in callback was used) Tj ET
0.120 0.170 0.260 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 500.0 Tm (  to test the dashboard handoff. The local static build and link checker passed.) Tj ET
0.925 0.957 1 rg 47 440 518 45 re f
0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 481.0 Tm (The actual Google account sign-in must still be completed in your browser to confirm the) Tj ET
