0.120 0.250 0.420 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 459.0 Tm (   chat.) Tj ET
0.080 0.310 0.680 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 437.0 Tm (Quick checklist) Tj ET
